OL,3,GSouth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FAn isolated
OL,6,Fshower or thunderstorm is possible
OL,7,Fthis evening, this most likely
OL,8,Fconfined to Gloucestershire. Otherwise
OL,9,Fa sunny and warm evening for many but
OL,10,Fcloudier in the west with misty low
OL,11,Fcloud possible across Cornwall.
OL,12,FRemaining rather warm and humid.
OL,13,
OL,14,CSaturday:FPerhaps the odd shower in
OL,15,Fthe west first thing. Otherwise, a dry
OL,16,Fand bright day for many, with lengthy
OL,17,Fsunny periods. Still very warm,
OL,18,Fespecially on south facing coasts.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
